%% Architecture Diagram for Proximity Service
flowchart TD
    Client[Client App] -->|Search & View| LB[Load Balancer]
    BizClient[Business Owner] -->|Manage Profile| LB

    LB --> GW[API Gateway]

    GW -->|GET /search| SearchSvc[Location Search Service]
    GW -->|POST/PUT /businesses| BizSvc[Business Profile Service]

    subgraph "Fast Read Path (In-Memory)"
        SearchSvc -->|1. Get 9 Geohashes| RedisGeohash[(Redis: Geohash Sets Cache)]
        SearchSvc -->|2. Get Profiles| RedisCache[(Redis: Profile Hash Cache)]
    end

    subgraph "Durable Write Path"
        BizSvc -->|1. Write| PrimaryDB[(PostgreSQL / Cassandra)]
        PrimaryDB -->|2. CDC / Event| Kafka[Kafka / Event Bus]
    end

    subgraph "Async Index Updater (Geo-distributed)"
        Kafka --> Worker[Index Worker]
        Worker -->|3. Update Sets| RedisGeohash
        Worker -->|4. Update Hash| RedisCache
    end
